@Graff 正式宣布由流行音樂天團 BTS 成員 Jung Kook @mnijungkook 擔任全新全球品牌大使。Jung Kook 同時驚艷亮相於全新 Laurence Graff Signature 系列宣傳廣告中，在綻放多面折射光芒的格拉夫經典綠調與金色背景下，完美演繹了該經典中性系列作品；他在片中隨心混搭疊戴項鏈、吊墜、手鐲、耳環及耳骨夾等多款別具一格的全新設計，將系列標誌性的琢面輪廓延伸至大膽奪目的鏈環與極具現代感的幾何線條中，盡顯個人風格。

@Graff officially announced Jung Kook (@mnijungkook), a member of the pop music group BTS, as its new global brand ambassador. Jung Kook also made a stunning appearance in the new Laurence Graff Signature campaign, perfectly embodying the classic unisex collection against a backdrop of Graff’s iconic green and gold tones that radiate multifaceted light. In the campaign, he casually mixes and matches various unique new designs, including necklaces, pendants, bracelets, earrings, and ear cuffs, extending the collection’s signature faceted silhouettes to bold, eye-catching chains and modern geometric lines, showcasing his personal style.

Credit : Graff

